@startuml
title P3 Acceptance - Evidence and Dependency Map

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
left to right direction

rectangle "Upstream implementation stories" {
  [P3 live PTT\nC1-C2 evidence + rollback notes] as Live
  [P3 capture quality\nC3 matrix + capability wording] as Capture
  [P3 E2EE media\nC4-C6 proof + key lifecycle] as Crypto
  [P3 automation\nC7 proof + revoke semantics] as Auto
  [P1 compliance baseline\npolicy + moderation + Store ops] as Compliance
}

rectangle "P3 acceptance story" {
  [Gate matrix + review contract] as Matrix
  [Observability + health views] as Metrics
  [C1-C3 live platform matrix] as C123
  [C4-C6 crypto/privacy acceptance] as C456
  [C7 automation safety acceptance] as C7
  [External security review closure] as Review
  [Rollout + rollback + recovery drills] as Rollback
  [7-day beta + incident review] as Beta
  [Promotion packet + disclosures] as Packet
}

Live --> Matrix
Live --> Metrics
Capture --> Matrix
Capture --> C123
Crypto --> C456
Crypto --> Review
Crypto --> Rollback
Auto --> C7
Auto --> Review
Auto --> Beta
Compliance --> C456
Compliance --> Packet

Matrix --> Metrics
Matrix --> C123
Matrix --> C456
Matrix --> C7
Metrics --> C123
Metrics --> C456
Metrics --> C7
Metrics --> Rollback
Metrics --> Beta
C123 --> Review
C123 --> Rollback
C456 --> Review
C456 --> Rollback
C7 --> Review
C7 --> Rollback
Review --> Beta
Rollback --> Beta
C123 --> Packet
C456 --> Packet
C7 --> Packet
Review --> Packet
Rollback --> Packet
Beta --> Packet

note bottom of Packet
Final packet maps every artifact to:
- C1-C7
- 21.4 non-functional gates
- 18 rollout / rollback order
- exact live_ptt vs e2ee_media claims
end note

@enduml
